WEBVTT

00:01.016 --> 00:03.352
[theme music playing]

01:23.640 --> 01:27.853
DELICIOUS IN DUNGEON

01:39.948 --> 01:42.868
Hey, you guys?
Are we sure this is the right way?

01:42.951 --> 01:44.911
Yup, this is correct.

01:45.412 --> 01:47.539
According to our trusty map,

01:47.623 --> 01:49.833
these stairs should lead
right to the fifth floor,

01:49.916 --> 01:51.251
near the orc settlement.

01:51.335 --> 01:53.170
[wind whistling]

01:53.253 --> 01:55.589
[Chilchuck] Seems pretty sketchy.

01:56.840 --> 01:58.216
[Laios] This is amazing.

01:58.300 --> 02:00.510
Look at all these different Tentacles.

02:01.094 --> 02:03.263
The orcs must have pulled
a fast one on us.

02:03.347 --> 02:05.349
There's no way they would leave this be.

02:05.432 --> 02:06.516
-[Laios] I don't know.
-Hmm?

02:06.600 --> 02:08.518
It does connect to their settlement.

02:09.102 --> 02:11.021
Makes sense
they'd want to keep people out.

02:11.104 --> 02:12.272
[sword clangs]

02:12.356 --> 02:14.900
Let's press on for now.

02:14.983 --> 02:17.611
-[Laios grunting]
-I think it would save us time <i>and</i> energy

02:17.694 --> 02:19.780
if we just found a different way.

02:19.863 --> 02:22.157
[groans]
Huh?

02:22.240 --> 02:25.410
Careful. Don't get too close to the wall.

02:25.494 --> 02:26.536
[shrieks]

02:26.620 --> 02:29.164
These monsters like to hide their bodies
inside of them.

02:29.790 --> 02:31.458
[Chilchuck]
<i>Lots of Tentacles usually means</i>

02:31.541 --> 02:33.293
-<i>that the walls are hollowed out.</i>
-[whirring]

02:33.377 --> 02:35.921
<i>Those things love to set up camp in there.</i>

02:36.004 --> 02:39.132
<i>They interfere with devices,grow on treasure chests,</i>

02:39.216 --> 02:41.385
<i>and are just a general pain in the ass.</i>

02:42.094 --> 02:45.180
<i>I hate themalmost as much as I hate Mimics!</i>

02:45.263 --> 02:47.432
[grunts]
There.

02:47.516 --> 02:50.435
I think we've made very good progress…

02:51.395 --> 02:53.313
-[wind whistling]
-Huh?

02:54.398 --> 02:55.565
That's weird.

02:55.649 --> 02:58.610
The orcs should've passed through here
to get to the third floor.

02:58.694 --> 03:00.779
[Laios]
But how'd they get through all this?

03:00.862 --> 03:02.197
-[rustling]
-Huh?

03:02.280 --> 03:03.490
[whispers]
Something's here.

03:03.573 --> 03:04.741
Be careful.

03:08.995 --> 03:10.664
[squelches]

03:10.747 --> 03:12.999
-[tense music playing]
-[gasps]

03:13.083 --> 03:14.209
[Laios] Kensuke!

03:14.292 --> 03:15.502
[Chilchuck] Ugh, Giant Frog!

03:15.585 --> 03:17.671
[Marcille] Ugh, gross!

03:17.754 --> 03:19.923
[Laios] No! What have you done?

03:20.006 --> 03:21.800
Stand back! <i>Aslam!</i>

03:25.011 --> 03:26.471
-[thuds]
-[snickers]

03:27.222 --> 03:28.974
[Marcille] Hey!

03:29.057 --> 03:29.891
[Marcille gasps]

03:29.975 --> 03:32.144
Ambrosia!

03:33.228 --> 03:34.479
Hmm?

03:34.563 --> 03:35.647
[frogs croaking]

03:35.731 --> 03:37.149
[Marcille screams]

03:38.150 --> 03:39.401
[Senshi grunts]

03:39.484 --> 03:41.027
-[Laios] Senshi, behind you!
-Huh?

03:41.862 --> 03:43.155
[Senshi grunting]

03:43.238 --> 03:44.906
[suspenseful music playing]

03:44.990 --> 03:46.533
-[grunting continues]
-Don't let go, okay?

03:46.616 --> 03:47.909
Do you have a plan?

03:47.993 --> 03:51.913
-M-My magic should do the trick!
-No! We're too close!

03:51.997 --> 03:54.833
[Chilchuck] <i>This is bad.What should we do?</i>

03:54.916 --> 03:55.792
[gasps]

03:56.376 --> 03:58.295
<i>Wait. That Tentacle.</i>

03:59.129 --> 04:02.174
<i>Something about it seems… out of place.</i>

04:02.716 --> 04:04.676
<i>I'll bet it's all tangled up in a trap.</i>

04:05.385 --> 04:08.221
<i>I wonder if there's any wayI can make use of that.</i>

04:09.181 --> 04:10.307
<i>But how?</i>

04:10.390 --> 04:14.436
<i>If I touch it directly,I'll be in for a world of hurt.</i>

04:15.395 --> 04:16.313
[gasps]

04:17.898 --> 04:19.691
-Hey, Laios!
-Huh?

04:19.775 --> 04:22.944
Why don't the Tentacles
seem to be hurting the Giant Frogs at all?

04:23.028 --> 04:24.446
[gasps]

04:24.529 --> 04:25.697
Uh…

04:25.781 --> 04:28.450
[Laios] I don't know.
That's just how they're made?

04:28.533 --> 04:31.453
[Chilchuck] <i>Real helpful,Mr. Monsterpedia!</i>

04:31.536 --> 04:34.456
-[Senshi] Ah, the curiosity of youth.
-[grunting]

04:34.539 --> 04:35.957
[Chilchuck sighs]
Whatever.

04:36.041 --> 04:38.460
[suspenseful music playing]

04:38.543 --> 04:39.961
[disgusted groan]

04:41.797 --> 04:43.965
[grunts, gasps]

04:44.049 --> 04:46.510
[all grunting]

04:46.593 --> 04:47.594
[Laios and Marcille gasp]

04:47.677 --> 04:49.429
Wait, what are you doing?

04:51.389 --> 04:52.516
[exhales nervously]

04:53.183 --> 04:54.142
[grunts]

04:54.226 --> 04:56.186
[Chilchuck] <i>It doesn't hurt!I can do this!</i>

04:56.269 --> 04:57.103
[grunts]

04:57.187 --> 04:58.355
What the…

04:58.438 --> 05:01.358
[grunting]
<i>It won't come out!</i>

05:01.441 --> 05:03.276
[grunting continues]

05:03.360 --> 05:04.736
[all grunting, yelp]

05:05.570 --> 05:06.446
[croaks]

05:06.530 --> 05:07.739
[grunts]
Come on!

05:08.698 --> 05:11.117
[all] Chilchuck! No!

05:11.201 --> 05:13.245
[tense music playing]

05:21.378 --> 05:23.380
-[all whimper]
-All right, quick, let's get him out!

05:23.463 --> 05:25.257
[Laios grunting]

05:25.799 --> 05:28.218
[gasps, coughing]

05:28.844 --> 05:31.221
-Phew. He's alive. Uh?
-[Marcille] Show me your hands!

05:31.805 --> 05:33.473
No way. They're not hurt?

05:33.557 --> 05:34.850
This frog skin.

05:34.933 --> 05:37.435
You used it like gloves
to protect your hands.

05:37.519 --> 05:39.354
That's really smart.

05:39.437 --> 05:40.856
Hmm…

05:42.190 --> 05:43.733
-[sighs]
-[Laios] Uh, Chilchuck?

05:43.817 --> 05:47.320
-Huh?
-This here is a great idea!

05:48.780 --> 05:50.866
[Laios] <i>Start an incision at its belly,</i>

05:50.949 --> 05:52.784
<i>and completely skin the frog.</i>

05:53.702 --> 05:55.161
Uh, hang on, I--

05:55.245 --> 05:57.080
[Senshi] For the Tentacles, peel the skin.

05:57.163 --> 05:57.998
Huh?

05:58.081 --> 06:00.709
Gather the parts that have thin tips,
set them aside,

06:00.792 --> 06:02.627
and boil the thicker parts.

06:03.587 --> 06:06.506
Once done, mash them up
and mix them with flour.

06:06.590 --> 06:10.010
Shape them into cylinders,
and gently press with a fork,

06:10.093 --> 06:11.970
then boil once more.

06:12.053 --> 06:12.888
Senshi…

06:12.971 --> 06:13.889
-[Laios] Hang the skins…
-Huh?

06:13.972 --> 06:15.515
…of the Giant Frogs to dry,

06:15.599 --> 06:18.518
-<i>take measurements, and begin sewing.</i>
-[inaudible]

06:18.602 --> 06:22.147
[Senshi] Add olive oil,
garlic, and chili peppers,

06:22.230 --> 06:26.026
then the frog leg meat,
fry it all up, and…

06:26.109 --> 06:27.360
[both] It's ready!

06:27.444 --> 06:30.030
TENTACLES GNOCCHI,
TENTACLES PASTA, FROG SUIT

06:30.113 --> 06:32.407
[Marcille] <i>I can't believe these guys!</i>

06:32.490 --> 06:34.200
Could you both take turns?

06:34.284 --> 06:37.287
Before I could even pick
who to stop first, it was too late!

06:37.370 --> 06:39.581
Don't be like that. Just try it on.

06:39.664 --> 06:42.584
[Senshi] Yes, yes, come on.
Go and take a little bite.

06:42.667 --> 06:44.794
[Marcille] I told you to take turns!

06:44.878 --> 06:47.589
Hmph. No way
you're getting me to wear that.

06:48.632 --> 06:49.633
[men] Hmm…

06:49.716 --> 06:51.635
[all whispering]

06:51.718 --> 06:55.388
If you wore this, Marcille,
we think you'd look real cute.

06:57.098 --> 06:59.225
[intriguing music playing]

07:00.977 --> 07:02.270
[groans]

07:03.188 --> 07:04.564
[inhales deeply]

07:06.274 --> 07:08.401
[mellow music playing]

07:09.361 --> 07:10.820
[Chilchuck] It's great! Really.

07:10.904 --> 07:12.530
[Senshi] What a nice color on you.

07:12.614 --> 07:15.784
[Laios] So neat how the eye parts
make it look like we have little ears.

07:15.867 --> 07:17.285
[Marcille] Let's go.

07:17.369 --> 07:18.453
[Laios] Yes, ma'am.

07:22.123 --> 07:25.001
[gasps]
Amazing! It doesn't hurt a bit!

07:25.085 --> 07:27.796
Ugh, this stuff is giving me
the heebie-jeebies!

07:28.380 --> 07:29.798
[Laios] So beautiful.

07:30.799 --> 07:32.050
And yummy.

07:34.386 --> 07:35.428
[Marcille gasps]

07:35.512 --> 07:36.888
[Marcille exclaims happily]

07:37.514 --> 07:38.515
Kensuke!

07:38.598 --> 07:39.808
Ambrosia!

07:42.394 --> 07:43.812
-[Marcille] Guys?
-[all] Hmm?

07:43.895 --> 07:45.522
[Laios] The castle town.

07:46.189 --> 07:48.400
[Marcille]
We're already on the fifth floor!

07:48.984 --> 07:51.444
[foreboding music playing]

07:53.029 --> 07:55.407
[Laios] Looks like they left in a hurry.

07:55.490 --> 07:58.410
So the orcs were telling the truth then.

07:58.493 --> 08:01.913
And that means
the Red Dragon can't be far off.

08:01.997 --> 08:05.041
Let's stay on our guard
and see what else we can find here.

08:05.125 --> 08:06.042
Right.

08:06.126 --> 08:07.043
[Senshi grunts]

08:07.127 --> 08:09.004
-Hey, uh…
-[Senshi] Hmm? Hmm…

08:09.087 --> 08:12.007
Laios… is this frog blood?

08:12.090 --> 08:15.552
It hardened onto my clothes
and now I can't get this thing off of me.

08:16.136 --> 08:19.055
It's because I didn't really have the time
to completely tan it.

08:20.098 --> 08:21.933
We're fighting the dragon like this?

08:22.017 --> 08:24.436
[gloomy music playing]

08:24.519 --> 08:25.854
[Marcille] Forget the dragon!

08:25.937 --> 08:28.440
How am I gonna look Falin
in the eyes, huh?

08:28.523 --> 08:31.443
[Marcille] Answer me!
[echoing]

08:34.988 --> 08:36.656
-[portal warbles]
-[groans]

08:37.907 --> 08:39.826
-[portal warbles]
-Hmm?

08:39.909 --> 08:41.828
[whimpering]

08:43.997 --> 08:44.831
[retches]

08:44.914 --> 08:47.834
-[Namari] My insides don't feel so good.
-Kiki, Kaka.

08:47.917 --> 08:50.253
[Mr. Tansu] Show Namari to the guest room.

08:50.920 --> 08:52.088
[both] Hmm.

08:52.172 --> 08:55.842
While you do that,
I will go report to the Island Lord.

08:55.925 --> 08:58.094
[birds chirping]

09:02.682 --> 09:05.852
[Island Lord] So, how was the dungeon?

09:05.935 --> 09:08.521
The thing to be most concerned about

09:08.605 --> 09:10.857
is that it has become more perilous.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.984
Treasure down to the third floor

09:13.068 --> 09:14.569
has been stripped bare.

09:14.652 --> 09:17.363
Hideouts for outlaws are on the rise.

09:17.447 --> 09:20.950
[Mr. Tansu] <i>And orcs have been appearingon the upper floors</i>

09:21.034 --> 09:24.120
<i>and are frequently causing problems.</i>

09:24.204 --> 09:26.414
[Mr. Tansu]
I would suggest sending in troops

09:26.498 --> 09:27.957
or offering a bounty.

09:28.041 --> 09:29.250
[Island Lord] Hmm…

09:29.334 --> 09:32.128
How did they even manage
to find their way in?

09:32.212 --> 09:36.174
Perhaps the pathways were connected
from old dwarven tunnels.

09:36.257 --> 09:39.135
Orcs have been known
to settle in such places.

09:39.219 --> 09:40.637
Dwarves, you say?

09:40.720 --> 09:43.014
What a truly troublesome lot they are.

09:43.098 --> 09:44.766
[Island Lord] <i>They're like moles.</i>

09:44.849 --> 09:48.019
<i>No matter how many holes we close,another pops up.</i>

09:48.103 --> 09:50.480
<i>Long ago, when the elves and dwarves</i>

09:50.563 --> 09:53.441
<i>split between east and westbecause of a war,</i>

09:53.525 --> 09:57.779
<i>the dwarves hid in these lands,waiting for the elves to attack.</i>

09:57.862 --> 10:01.741
[Island Lord] Even after the war ended,
they continued digging holes,

10:01.825 --> 10:04.786
eventually turning the Golden Country
into a dungeon.

10:05.370 --> 10:08.164
I've even heard
that the dungeon continues to grow

10:08.248 --> 10:11.126
because of the descendants
of those very dwarves.

10:11.209 --> 10:14.170
Let us move on
from unsubstantiated rumors.

10:14.754 --> 10:17.674
[Mr. Tansu] Here are the drawings
of the magic circles.

10:17.757 --> 10:20.176
They are in the usual Elvish language.

10:20.260 --> 10:23.680
And according to the penmanship,
it is the same author.

10:23.763 --> 10:27.684
And there are no signs
of anyone else modifying them at all.

10:28.268 --> 10:30.812
There's no mistaking it,
the lord of the dungeon,

10:30.895 --> 10:34.190
or should I say the Mad Mage,
drew these magic circles.

10:34.274 --> 10:36.609
Is this individual an elf?

10:36.693 --> 10:38.486
I cannot say with certainty,

10:38.570 --> 10:41.739
but it's unlikely
a tall-man or dwarf cast it.

10:41.823 --> 10:43.449
This is concerning.

10:43.533 --> 10:45.118
-Hmm?
-[Island Lord] The thing is,

10:45.201 --> 10:48.830
the other day, I received a letter
from the elves of the west.

10:48.913 --> 10:53.209
<i>It said, "The dungeon belongs to us.Relinquish it."</i>

10:53.918 --> 10:56.045
[bangs on table]
How utterly conceited!

10:56.129 --> 10:58.047
They're the ones
who gave the lands to the humans

10:58.131 --> 11:01.301
after taking and squandering
those lands from the dwarves.

11:02.010 --> 11:03.386
Just ignore them.

11:03.469 --> 11:06.181
This land was bestowed to me
by the king of the elves.

11:06.264 --> 11:08.057
So I'm afraid that's not possible.

11:08.141 --> 11:09.434
[groans]

11:10.059 --> 11:12.562
They'll take the entire island.

11:12.645 --> 11:14.355
I certainly hope not.

11:14.439 --> 11:16.774
There is most likely
a vast amount of riches

11:16.858 --> 11:18.776
still in the bowels of that dungeon.

11:18.860 --> 11:20.069
My Lord,

11:20.153 --> 11:22.947
their objective
is not any material treasure,

11:23.031 --> 11:26.201
<i>but the immortality spellcast on the dungeon.</i>

11:26.284 --> 11:28.661
This spell
that tethers the soul to the body

11:28.745 --> 11:30.496
is still a great mystery.

11:30.580 --> 11:32.540
And once that mystery becomes unraveled,

11:32.624 --> 11:35.710
its value will far exceed
any amount of gold.

11:35.793 --> 11:38.880
We should solve it before the elves do.

11:38.963 --> 11:42.175
So we should trace
all of the magic circles and study them?

11:42.258 --> 11:43.718
-[worried grunt]
-[Mr. Tansu] That's not enough!

11:43.801 --> 11:47.597
A powerful spell such as this
is bound to have a schematic.

11:47.680 --> 11:49.224
You should seek it out.

11:49.891 --> 11:51.476
After we get our hands on it,

11:51.559 --> 11:54.187
then you can agree
to give them back the dungeon.

11:54.938 --> 11:58.149
Once they realize
we possess that valuable knowledge,

11:58.233 --> 12:00.568
the elves will see you as an equal.

12:00.652 --> 12:05.031
No, they will kneel before you
to curry your favor.

12:05.114 --> 12:06.991
You… you think so?

12:07.075 --> 12:09.202
So where do you think it might be?

12:09.869 --> 12:11.287
Isn't it obvious?

12:11.829 --> 12:14.791
The lord of the dungeon
would have possession over it.

12:14.874 --> 12:18.211
So we should keep sending in adventurers
to search the premises?

12:18.294 --> 12:19.504
That is correct.

12:19.587 --> 12:21.214
Monster extermination

12:21.297 --> 12:24.050
and buying artifacts from the dungeon
is pivotal.

12:24.133 --> 12:27.512
Spend your coin and aid those adventurers.

12:27.595 --> 12:29.180
I understand.

12:29.264 --> 12:31.724
I will put out a reward for the orcs.

12:31.808 --> 12:33.518
And my reply to the elves?

12:33.601 --> 12:36.646
I will pen something
that buys us some time.

12:36.729 --> 12:38.189
[sighs]

12:38.273 --> 12:40.900
[Mr. Tansu] <i>"Laios" was his name, yes?</i>

12:40.984 --> 12:46.406
<i>He was quite the skilled adventurer,but I wonder just how far he will go.</i>

12:49.534 --> 12:51.703
-[door opens]
-[groans]

12:52.954 --> 12:54.914
-[Kiki] Good morning, Namari.
-Huh?

12:54.998 --> 12:56.499
How are you feeling?

12:56.100 --> 12:59.210
Wait! Where's my axe?

13:00.003 --> 13:01.838
-Your stuff is there.
-[groans]

13:01.921 --> 13:02.922
Also…

13:03.006 --> 13:04.841
this is from Grandpa Tansu.

13:07.385 --> 13:09.012
Isn't this too much?

13:09.095 --> 13:10.805
You can think of it as a retainer,

13:10.888 --> 13:12.890
for when he needs you in the future.

13:12.974 --> 13:14.892
Oh. Thanks a lot.

13:14.976 --> 13:16.644
I appreciate it.

13:16.728 --> 13:18.813
Do you need a town guide?

13:18.896 --> 13:21.566
[birds chirping]

13:21.649 --> 13:23.359
So, where are you staying?

13:23.443 --> 13:24.777
You must be going to rest up.

13:24.861 --> 13:27.655
Huh? Not yet.
I'm going back to the dungeon.

13:27.739 --> 13:29.574
-[Kaka] Hmm?
-Mm? Oh, my.

13:29.657 --> 13:31.075
You're returning already?

13:31.159 --> 13:34.579
[Namari] No, no. I just have
some business at the temple nearby.

13:35.580 --> 13:36.414
Business?

13:36.497 --> 13:37.373
Business.

13:38.166 --> 13:41.085
[birds chirping]

13:46.758 --> 13:48.092
Revivals.

13:48.176 --> 13:50.595
Huh? Oh, Namari!

13:51.179 --> 13:53.681
Those are the eyes
of someone looking for something.

13:53.765 --> 13:55.475
-[annoyed grunt]
-[receptionist scoffs]

13:55.558 --> 13:57.935
So, is it a thing or a person?

13:58.019 --> 13:59.020
Person.

13:59.103 --> 14:01.814
A female tall-man, hair light brown.

14:01.898 --> 14:03.983
Length would be
about down to the shoulders.

14:04.067 --> 14:05.276
Her age is…

14:05.860 --> 14:08.696
somewhere from teens to forties.

14:08.780 --> 14:11.282
[receptionist] Hang on.
Is this Laios' sister?

14:11.366 --> 14:14.327
There's no question
that girl is in her twenties.

14:14.410 --> 14:16.037
Go get your eyes checked out.

14:16.621 --> 14:19.540
Give me a break. How should I know, huh?

14:19.624 --> 14:20.541
Hmm.

14:21.125 --> 14:23.669
Nothing by that description
has been brought here yet.

14:24.587 --> 14:25.588
I see.

14:27.465 --> 14:28.966
[narrator] <i>The fifth floor,</i>

14:29.717 --> 14:33.179
<i>exiting the Golden Castle,leads to the castle town.</i>

14:33.763 --> 14:37.767
<i>The area has expandedand distorted due to magic,</i>

14:37.850 --> 14:41.354
<i>but you can still sensephantoms of its former glory.</i>

14:42.271 --> 14:44.816
<i>A person passing by just out of sight.</i>

14:45.775 --> 14:48.194
<i>The sound of someone whispering.</i>

14:48.277 --> 14:51.531
<i>These strange feelingslinger like a dream.</i>

14:53.866 --> 14:56.702
So this is
where the orcs set up their post.

14:56.786 --> 14:59.288
[Laios]
Looks like they left here in a hurry too.

14:59.372 --> 15:01.707
Their food storage is a complete mess.

15:01.791 --> 15:03.584
[Marcille] What a horrible smell.

15:03.668 --> 15:06.212
[Laios] Must have been ransacked
by nearby monsters.

15:06.295 --> 15:09.132
[Marcille]
Looks like the flour and alcohol are okay.

15:09.215 --> 15:10.216
[Senshi] Oh.

15:10.299 --> 15:12.009
Let's make some bread.

15:12.093 --> 15:14.220
If the orcs come back, they'll be mad.

15:14.303 --> 15:17.723
[Senshi] Nah, we gave them vegetables,
so we should be squared away.

15:19.809 --> 15:20.726
[door creaks]

15:22.895 --> 15:23.980
[shocked gasp]

15:24.063 --> 15:26.315
[tense music playing]

15:30.570 --> 15:31.904
[Laios] Wargs.

15:32.613 --> 15:34.740
Was this… the Red Dragon?

15:34.824 --> 15:35.950
Seems so.

15:36.033 --> 15:38.536
Looks like they all got hit
by its fire breath attack.

15:40.121 --> 15:43.666
Going by the smoke,
it must have just been here.

15:43.749 --> 15:45.418
[Marcille] Hey, Laios?

15:46.002 --> 15:48.713
I remember you saying
that dragons aren't really active,

15:48.796 --> 15:50.923
that they mostly sleep a lot.

15:51.007 --> 15:54.427
But going off what the orcs said
and seeing all this,

15:54.510 --> 15:56.179
it's been moving around ever since,

15:56.262 --> 15:59.432
and might even be wandering around nearby.

16:00.016 --> 16:03.019
I think we could have won
against a sleeping dragon,

16:03.102 --> 16:05.938
but… can we really defeat it now?

16:06.522 --> 16:08.191
What if we lose, or…

16:08.274 --> 16:10.443
what if she's already been digested?

16:10.526 --> 16:11.861
-Hey, it's all right.
-[Marcille sobs]

16:11.944 --> 16:13.154
Take a deep breath.

16:13.237 --> 16:14.947
Let's just think it all through.

16:15.031 --> 16:16.866
Well, whatever you decide,

16:16.949 --> 16:19.452
don't forget you'll have to fight it
with just three people.

16:20.328 --> 16:21.662
[Senshi] Just three?

16:23.539 --> 16:25.208
[shouts]
Don't look at me like that!

16:25.291 --> 16:27.460
I told you
that I'm not built for fighting!

16:27.543 --> 16:30.463
My job was to help get all of you here,
and that's all!

16:30.546 --> 16:31.756
-We know that.
-[Marcille sniffles]

16:31.839 --> 16:33.132
We weren't blaming you.

16:33.799 --> 16:35.968
I… may have overreacted.

16:36.052 --> 16:39.388
[Senshi] So, how are you defeating dragons
before now?

16:39.472 --> 16:42.350
Well, it depended
on a bunch of different factors, but…

16:42.433 --> 16:45.144
[Laios] <i>Falin would castprotection spells against fire.</i>

16:45.937 --> 16:48.356
<i>Namari, Shuro, and Iwould slow its movement.</i>

16:48.439 --> 16:51.359
<i>Marcille would weaken itwith explosion magic.</i>

16:51.442 --> 16:53.653
<i>And Shuro would deliver the final blow.</i>

16:54.445 --> 16:57.823
-I think that's how it would go at least.
-[Senshi] Hmm…

16:57.907 --> 17:00.868
But that's not gonna work
with the party we have now though.

17:00.952 --> 17:03.871
We have to think of a plan
that'll work for the three of us.

17:04.956 --> 17:07.542
[Laios]
<i>Dragons are covered in super tough scales.</i>

17:07.625 --> 17:10.378
<i>Making them resistantto magic and weapons.</i>

17:11.087 --> 17:12.713
<i>But under its neck,</i>

17:12.797 --> 17:15.758
<i>there's an inverse scalethat serves as its weak spot.</i>

17:15.841 --> 17:17.885
If we strike there, we can win!

17:17.969 --> 17:19.512
[Senshi] Under the neck?

17:19.595 --> 17:23.140
And about how big would you say
this Red Dragon is exactly?

17:23.224 --> 17:24.600
How to explain…

17:24.684 --> 17:26.769
Oh. See that there?

17:26.852 --> 17:29.772
[Laios] It's about as tall
as that crumbled passageway.

17:30.481 --> 17:31.524
[Chilchuck] I mean,

17:31.607 --> 17:34.443
that literally looks like
the dragon bonked his head there.

17:34.527 --> 17:36.279
[Laios] Oh, that makes sense.

17:36.362 --> 17:38.072
[Senshi] It's quite huge.

17:38.155 --> 17:41.409
It'll be no easy task
striking the scale from that height.

17:41.492 --> 17:43.035
Yeah, you are not kidding.

17:43.744 --> 17:46.998
[Laios] Hmm… Let's try getting up there.

17:49.500 --> 17:50.960
It's pretty high up.

17:51.043 --> 17:53.462
What if we jumped
on the dragon's neck from here?

17:53.546 --> 17:55.548
-You can't do that!
-What she said.

17:55.631 --> 17:57.800
I can cast abjuration spells,

17:57.883 --> 18:00.011
but they won't be as good as Falin's.

18:00.094 --> 18:02.888
If you fall from this height,
you'll definitely hurt yourself,

18:02.972 --> 18:04.557
and it'll all be over.

18:04.640 --> 18:07.435
And that's not all.
What about its fire breath?

18:07.518 --> 18:09.061
None of us can outrun that.

18:09.145 --> 18:11.147
Oh, yeah. Namari also said

18:11.230 --> 18:13.941
that Senshi's axe
won't stand a chance against it.

18:14.025 --> 18:16.027
[Marcille] What about your weapon, Laios?

18:16.777 --> 18:18.237
You'd have to keep it occupied

18:18.321 --> 18:20.406
while I'm charging up
a strong explosion spell,

18:20.489 --> 18:22.491
one that will knock it unconscious.

18:22.575 --> 18:25.703
And after that,
someone will have to fatally wound it.

18:25.786 --> 18:29.165
Do you think
you and Senshi can pull all of that off?

18:29.248 --> 18:31.208
Of course. I'm sure we can.

18:31.292 --> 18:32.585
Okay. How?

18:32.668 --> 18:34.211
Hmm… Huh?

18:35.796 --> 18:37.590
Instead of hitting the dragon,

18:37.673 --> 18:40.343
what if we were
to blow up a structure instead?

18:40.926 --> 18:44.430
[Laios] There are lots of houses
and bridges that extend between buildings.

18:45.431 --> 18:48.100
We blow one up
when the dragon goes and walks under it,

18:48.184 --> 18:50.645
and the rubble
should slow down its movement.

18:50.728 --> 18:52.772
With all that rubble weighing it down,

18:52.855 --> 18:55.358
the inverse scale
will be within striking distance.

18:55.441 --> 18:56.609
[both exclaim]

18:56.692 --> 18:59.737
[Laios] We won't be able to buy much time
when we're actually fighting it.

19:00.446 --> 19:03.866
But we <i>can</i> lure it somewhere we want
while we're running away from it.

19:04.450 --> 19:06.369
These paths are narrow for a Red Dragon.

19:07.078 --> 19:09.872
It should also be tired
from being so active.

19:09.955 --> 19:13.793
With the proper route,
we can tire it out even more.

19:13.876 --> 19:16.587
I see.
Well, I can probably help with that then.

19:16.671 --> 19:17.505
Really?

19:17.588 --> 19:20.007
-Thank you, Chilchuck! I'm so happy!
-[grunting]

19:20.091 --> 19:23.302
But I wonder
why the dragon's not sleeping though.

19:23.386 --> 19:25.638
And why did it show up on floor five?

19:25.721 --> 19:28.933
It seems to be wandering around
narrow areas that it doesn't like.

19:29.016 --> 19:30.976
Maybe it's mating time?

19:31.060 --> 19:32.019
Probably not.

19:32.103 --> 19:33.312
Oh, hang on a sec.

19:33.396 --> 19:36.774
Didn't Namari say Senshi's pan
is made out of a really cool metal?

19:36.857 --> 19:37.775
[Chilchuck] What was it?

19:37.858 --> 19:39.610
Something about
"blocking the dragon's fangs"

19:39.694 --> 19:41.737
and "smashing through its bones", I think?

19:41.821 --> 19:43.364
Oh! That's right!

19:43.447 --> 19:45.783
She said that blacksmiths
dream about the stuff!

19:45.866 --> 19:48.703
If that's true,
it must be able to block its fire breath!

19:48.786 --> 19:49.870
[Marcille] Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

19:49.954 --> 19:52.415
Well, that's one of our problems
taken care of.

19:52.498 --> 19:55.292
Sure that knife isn't also made
from something special?

19:55.376 --> 19:57.878
[Marcille giggles]
We should've had Namari look at it, huh?

19:58.504 --> 20:00.756
I'm starting to feel like we can do this.

20:00.840 --> 20:03.426
Like they say,
"If there's a will, there's a way."

20:03.509 --> 20:06.554
Right! Let's finish
planning out our attack.

20:06.637 --> 20:08.556
[thrilling music playing]

20:16.647 --> 20:19.316
[inaudible]

20:22.403 --> 20:24.947
-[door opens, closes]
-Hmm?

20:25.906 --> 20:27.032
[Senshi] Ah, you're back.

20:27.116 --> 20:30.327
Senshi, why did you wander off?
We were wondering where you went.

20:30.411 --> 20:31.829
I was making bread.

20:31.912 --> 20:34.707
[Marcille] You know we're about
to fight a dragon, don't you?

20:34.790 --> 20:35.958
[Senshi] Of course.

20:36.041 --> 20:38.377
This will be quite the task,
don't you think?

20:38.461 --> 20:40.713
A good meal is most important.

20:40.796 --> 20:42.256
[Chilchuck and Marcille groan]

20:42.339 --> 20:45.885
We've already lost once to this dragon
because of an empty stomach.

20:45.968 --> 20:48.179
This time will be different, right?

20:48.262 --> 20:50.473
Oh! There's wine!

20:50.556 --> 20:53.476
[Senshi] I went and borrowed
a few things from the pantry.

20:53.559 --> 20:54.769
[grunts, groaning]

20:54.852 --> 20:56.771
Not until we beat the dragon.

20:56.854 --> 20:58.564
-[Chilchuck screaming in pain]
-[Senshi] We don't have any eggs,

20:58.647 --> 21:00.983
but we should still be able to make <i>that.</i>

21:03.360 --> 21:05.154
[Senshi]
Shave down some bread with a grater,

21:05.863 --> 21:08.908
season the Giant Frog meat
with salt and pepper.

21:09.617 --> 21:12.536
Dip the meat in a water and flour mixture,

21:12.620 --> 21:14.038
work in the breadcrumbs.

21:14.121 --> 21:17.041
Then heat some olive oil, and fry.

21:17.124 --> 21:19.543
[sizzling]

21:19.627 --> 21:23.214
Boil down some red wine and seasonings
to make a sauce.

21:25.883 --> 21:28.135
Hmm. It's ready!

21:28.219 --> 21:30.554
CUTLETS TO CONQUER THE RED DRAGON

21:30.638 --> 21:31.889
-Looks delicious!
-[inhales sharply]

21:31.972 --> 21:34.809
Once I started smelling it,
I got really hungry.

21:34.892 --> 21:36.811
[all] Let's dig in, everyone!

21:38.521 --> 21:39.814
It's so crispy!

21:39.897 --> 21:41.232
[exhales deeply]

21:42.024 --> 21:43.025
[sniffles]

21:43.692 --> 21:44.944
What's wrong, Marcille?

21:45.569 --> 21:47.863
Knowing these monster meals
will come to an end soon

21:47.947 --> 21:49.573
just got me a little emotional.

21:49.657 --> 21:52.076
[Senshi]
Well, let's not get ahead of ourselves.

21:55.830 --> 21:57.081
[soft grunt]

21:57.164 --> 22:00.125
[Laios] Everyone, I want to say something.

22:00.918 --> 22:04.338
I don't think I would've been able
to make it this far on my own.

22:04.421 --> 22:06.632
-[soft music playing]
-[Laios] Senshi, thank you.

22:07.174 --> 22:09.969
We were strangers
but you were still kind to us.

22:10.052 --> 22:13.931
Your food not only filled our stomachs
but… my heart as well.

22:14.557 --> 22:17.309
Chilchuck, if you weren't with us,

22:17.393 --> 22:19.770
we would've lost days
taking the long way down.

22:19.854 --> 22:21.438
That helped us so much.

22:22.189 --> 22:23.190
And Marcille,

22:24.024 --> 22:26.652
I'm sorry
for putting you through everything.

22:26.735 --> 22:29.947
When you said you'd come with us,
I was really happy.

22:30.698 --> 22:33.826
Everyone, thank you so much.

22:35.160 --> 22:37.329
[Marcille and Senshi
munching hurriedly, gulp]

22:37.413 --> 22:38.914
[Marcille and Senshi] O-Of course!

22:38.998 --> 22:39.999
You're so cringe!

22:40.082 --> 22:41.250
Sorry.

22:41.959 --> 22:43.752
-[plate clinking]
-Uh?

22:43.836 --> 22:46.005
-[clinking continues]
-[Laios] Is that…

22:46.672 --> 22:51.051
-[loud thudding]
-[rumbling]

22:52.845 --> 22:55.514
[dramatic music playing]

23:03.606 --> 23:06.150
It's even bigger
than I remembered it being.

23:06.233 --> 23:09.111
No kidding. Can we really defeat that?

23:09.820 --> 23:10.905
Oh. Huh?

23:10.988 --> 23:11.947
We'll be fine.

23:12.031 --> 23:13.657
We all got this far, didn't we?

23:14.533 --> 23:15.784
[Laios] Let's review the plan.

23:16.368 --> 23:19.622
Marcille has her spot,
which we'll lure the dragon to.

23:20.289 --> 23:22.207
Everyone ready?

23:22.291 --> 23:24.209
As soon as our health is in good shape.

23:25.044 --> 23:26.086
All right.

23:27.087 --> 23:28.380
Let's go!

23:28.464 --> 23:30.299
[dramatic music rises, fades]

23:31.050 --> 23:33.218
[closing theme music playing]
